    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Qaybihii Wadaaddada",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kooxihii reer Haaruunna waa kuwan. Wiilashii Haaruun waxay ahaayeen Naadaab, iyo Abiihuu, iyo Elecaasaar, iyo Iitaamaar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Naadaab iyo Abiihuuba aabbahood way ka hor dhinteen, oo carruurna ma ay lahayn, haddaba sidaas daraaddeed hawshii wadaadnimada waxaa samayn jiray Elecaasaar iyo Iitaamaar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Daa'uud oo ay la jiraan Saadooq oo ahaa reer Elecaasaar iyo Axiimeleg oo ahaa reer Iitaamaar ayaa iyagii u kala qaybiyey sidii hawshoodu kala ahayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Elecaasaar waxaa laga dhex helay niman madax ah oo ka badan intii reer Iitaamaar laga helay, oo iyagii sidanaa loo kala qaybiyey, reer Elecaasaar waxaa ku jiray lix iyo toban nin, oo qolooyin madax u ah, oo reer Iitaamaarna waxaa ku jiray siddeed, sidii qolooyinkoodu kala ahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidanaa iyagii saami loogu kala qaybiyey, oo caynba caynkii kale waa lagu daray, waayo, waxaa jiray amiirro meesha quduuska ah, iyo amiirro Ilaah oo ahaa reer Elecaasaar iyo reer Iitaamaar labadaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Shemacyaah ina Netaneel oo karraanigii ahaa, oo ahaa reer Laawi ayaa iyagii ku hor qoray boqorkii, iyo amiirradii, iyo wadaadkii Saadooq, iyo Axiimeleg ina Aabyaataar, iyo madaxdii qolooyinkii wadaaddada iyo reer Laawi ahaa, in reer loo qaado reer Elecaasaar, reerna loo qaado reer Iitaamaar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba saamigii kowaad wuxuu u soo baxay Yehooyaariib, kii labaadna Yedacyaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kii saddexaadna Haarim, kii afraadna Secoriim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kii shanaadna Malkiiyaah, kii lixaadna Miyaamin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kii toddobaadna Haqoos, kii siddeedaadna Abiiyaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kii sagaalaadna Yeeshuuca, kii tobnaadna Shekaanyaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kii kow iyo tobnaadna Eliyaashiib, kii laba iyo tobnaadna Yaaqiim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kii saddex iyo tobnaadna Xufaah, kii afar iyo tobnaadna Yeshebe'aab, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kii shan iyo tobnaadna Bilgaah, kii lix iyo tobnaadna Immeer, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kii toddoba iyo tobnaadna Xeesiir, kii siddeed iyo tobnaadna Hafisees, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kii sagaal iyo tobnaadna Fetaxyaah, kii labaatanaadna Yexesqeel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kii kow iyo labaatanaadna Yaakiin, kii laba iyo labaatanaadna Gaamuul, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kii saddex iyo labaatanaadna Dalaayaah, kii afar iyo labaatanaadna Macasyaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaasu wuxuu ahaa qaynuunkii ay u kala qaybsanaayeen oo ay hawshooda ku qaban jireen, inay gurigii Rabbiga ku soo galaan qaynuunkii iyaga lagu soo dhiibay awowgood Haaruun, sidii Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil uu isaga ku amray.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Intii Ka Hadhay Reer Laawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Laawi intii hadhayna waxaa ka mid ahaa kuwan, wiilashii Camraam waxaa ka joogay Shuubaa'eel, wiilashii Shuubaa'eelna waxaa ka joogay Yexdeyaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer Rexabyaahna waxaa wiilashii Rexabyaah ka joogay Yishyaah oo madax ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer Isehaarna waxaa ka joogay Shelomoo, wiilashii Shelomoodna waxaa ka joogay Yaaxad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilashii Xebroonna waxaa ka joogay Yeriyaah oo madax ahaa, iyo Amaryaah oo ahaa kii labaad, iyo Yaxasii'eel oo ahaa kii saddexaad, iyo Yeqamcaam oo ahaa kii afraad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilashii Cusii'eelna waxaa ka joogay Miikaah, wiilashii Miikaahna waxaa ka joogay Shaamiir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Miikaah walaalkiisna wuxuu ahaa Yishyaah, wiilashii Yishyaahna waxaa ka joogay Sekaryaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilashii Meraariina waxaa ka joogay Maxlii iyo Mushii, wiilashii Yacasiyaahna waxaa ka joogay Benoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilashii Meraariina, waxaa reer Yacasiyaah ka joogay Benoo, iyo Shoham, iyo Sakuur, iyo Cibrii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer Maxliina waxaa ka joogay Elecaasaar, oo aan waxba wiilal lahayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer Qiishna waxaa ka joogay ina Qiish, oo ahaa Yeraxme'eel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer Mushii waxaa ka joogay Maxlii, iyo Ceeder, iyo Yeriimood. Kuwaasu waxay ahaayeen reer Laawi siday qolooyinkoodu kala ahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwanu iyana waxay riteen saami sidii walaalahood reer Haaruun ay yeeleen oo kale, oo waxay ku hor riteen Boqor Daa'uud, iyo Saadooq, iyo Axiimeleg, iyo kuwii madaxda u ahaa qolooyinkii wadaaddada iyo reer Laawi. Kan qolooyinkii madaxda u ahaa waxaa lagala mid dhigay sida kuwa walaalkiisa yar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
